             <td>1/185</td>\n                            <td>1/74</td>\n                            <td>1/180</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3>出玉率</h3>\n                <div class=\"tbl-scroll\"><table>\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 35%;\">設定</th>\n                            <th>出玉率</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定L</td>\n                            <td>ー</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>97.8%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>99.6%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>102.1%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>105.3%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>108.2%</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table></div>\n                <div class=\"caution\">\n                    <p> 注意</p>\n                    <p>設定Lは下パネルが点滅します。</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            \n        </div>\n       \n        <p class=\"js-menu\">基本情報</p>\n<div class=\"contents\">\n    <div class=\"left\">\n        <h3>天井・打ち方・詳細情報</h3>\n        <div class=\"tbl-scroll\"><table border=\"1\">\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <th style=\"width: 50%;\">項目</th>\n                    <th>記載</th>\n                </tr><tr>\n                    <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                        天井情報\n                    </td>\n                    <td>ボーナス間天井<br>天国スルー回数天井</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                        打ち方\n                    </td>\n                    <td>通常時の打ち方<br>ボーナス中の打ち方</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/下向きの矢印のアイコン素材.png\" class=\"icon-small\" alt=\"arrow\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                        ハイエナ詳細情報\n                    </td>\n                    <td>その他のハイエナ情報</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table></div>\n    </div>\n\n    \n</div>\n        <p class=\"js-menu\">数値詳細</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination1\">1G連獲得時のセグ</h3>\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/shanar__1.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                <div class=\"tbl-scroll\"><table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 50%;\">7セグ表示</th>\n                            <th>示唆内容</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>222</td>\n                            <td>設定2以上濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>333</td>\n                            <td>設定3以上濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>555</td>\n                            <td>設定5以上濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>666</td>\n                            <td>設定6濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table></div>\n                <p>ボーナス中に1G連を引いた際、7セグに「777」以外が示されれば特定設定以上がほぼ確定します。</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination2\">ピンク頭ボーナス終了時のランプ</h3>\n                <p>ピンク頭ボーナスが終わったタイミングでは、フェザーランプの発光色によって設定が示唆されます。</p>\n                <div class=\"tbl-scroll\"><table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 70%;\">ランプ</th>\n                            <th>示唆内容</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/shanar__7.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>白</p></td>\n                            <td>設定2以上<br>示唆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/shanar__6.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>青</p></td>\n                            <td>設定1・3・6<br>示唆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/shanar__5.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>黄</p></td>\n                            <td>設定2・3・6<br>示唆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/shanar__4.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>緑</p></td>\n                            <td>設定1・5・6<br>示唆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/shanar__3.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>赤</p></td>\n                            <td>設定2・5・6<br>示唆</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/shanar__2.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>レインボー</p></td>\n                            <td>設定5以上<br>濃厚</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <h3 id=\"destination3\">小役確率</h3>\n                <div class=\"tbl-scroll\"><table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 25%;\">設定</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 25%;\">共通ベルA</th>\n                            <th style=\"width: 25%;\">共通ベル合算</th>\n                            <th>リーチ目役</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定1</td>\n                            <td>1/23.2</td>\n                            <td>1/19.6</td>\n                            <td>1/2346.0</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定2</td>\n                            <td>1/22.2</td>\n                            <td>1/18.9</td>\n                            <td>1/2184.5</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定3</td>\n                            <td>1/21.2</td>\n                            <td>1/18.2</td>\n                            <td>1/2048.0</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定5</td>\n                            <td>1/20.4</td>\n                            <td>1/17.6</td>\n                            <td>1/1927.5</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td>設定6</td>\n                            <td>1/19.7</td>\n                            <td>1/17.1</td>\n                            <td>1/1820.4</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table></div>\n                <p>共通ベルAとリーチ目役は、設定が高いほど顔を出しやすくなります。</p>\n                <h3>共通ベルとリーチ目役の停止形</h3>\n                <div class=\"tbl-scroll\"><table border=\"1\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th style=\"width: 50%;\">共通ベルA</th>\n                            <th>共通ベルB</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/shanar__9.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/shanar__11.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <th colspan=\"2\">リーチ目役</th>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/shanar__12.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n                            <td><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/shanar__13.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table></div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"js-menu\" style=\"display: none;\">高設定狙いに必要な演出法則</p>\n        <div class=\"contents\" style=\"display: none;\">\n            <div class=\"left\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media.slolaboratory.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/24005602/noimage1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\">\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div